  "instructions": [
    "Heat oil in a large pan over medium heat and sauté the onion, ginger, and garlic until the onion is translucent.",
    "Add the cumin seeds and let them sizzle for a few seconds.",
    "Add the carrot, bell pepper, and red lentils and sauté for 2-3 minutes.",
    "Add the vegetable broth, barbeque sauce, cumin powder, coriander powder, turmeric powder, cayenne pepper, salt, and black pepper.",
    "Bring the mixture to a boil, then reduce the heat to low and simmer for 15-20 minutes.",
    "Use an immersion blender to puree the soup to your desired consistency.",
